# Bitwarden secret ids (project: prd). Values never live here.
#
# OWNER: create these four secrets in Bitwarden (project prd), then write
# their ids into this file with
#   BWS_ACCESS_TOKEN=... .github/scripts/bws-map.sh cmd-and-ctrl-monitoring prd \
#     CMDCTRL_MONITORING_GRAFANA_ADMIN_PASSWORD \
#     CMDCTRL_MONITORING_DISCORD_WEBHOOK_URL \
#     CMDCTRL_MONITORING_PUSH_HASH_PROD \
#     CMDCTRL_MONITORING_PUSH_HASH_DEV
# Until then the plan fails with "No value for required variable".
#
#   CMDCTRL_MONITORING_GRAFANA_ADMIN_PASSWORD  16+ chars, no single quote
#   CMDCTRL_MONITORING_DISCORD_WEBHOOK_URL     https://discord.com/api/webhooks/<id>/<token>
#   CMDCTRL_MONITORING_PUSH_HASH_PROD          bcrypt hash (caddy hash-password) of
#                                              cmd_and_ctrl's prod CMDCTRL_MONITORING_PUSH_PASSWORD
#   CMDCTRL_MONITORING_PUSH_HASH_DEV           same, for dev
